---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Developers" description="Resonance developer portal — quick start, SDK, API reference, and contributing guide.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan/5 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-32 pb-16 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">
        Developer Portal
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-white/60 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Everything you need to build with Resonance. Run locally in minutes, build custom detectors, or integrate the platform into your stack.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quick Start -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8">Quick Start</h2>
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-cyan/10 text-cyan text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Clone and build</h3>
        </div>
        <pre class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 overflow-x-auto text-sm font-mono text-white/80"><code>git clone https://github.com/resonance-project/resonance.git
cd resonance
cargo build --workspace</code></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-cyan/10 text-cyan text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Run the simulator</h3>
        </div>
        <pre class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 overflow-x-auto text-sm font-mono text-white/80"><code># Launch a 25-node simulated mesh
cargo run --bin resonance-edge -- simulate

# Or use Docker Compose for the full stack
docker compose up -d
docker compose exec platform resonance simulate --nodes 25 --environment suburban</code></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-cyan/10 text-cyan text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Access the console</h3>
        </div>
        <pre class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 overflow-x-auto text-sm font-mono text-white/80"><code># Platform API
curl http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health

# Real-time events via WebSocket
wscat -c ws://localhost:8080/ws/events

# Console UI
open http://localhost:3000</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SDK Overview -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8">SDK — Build Custom Detectors</h2>
    <p class="text-white/50 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      The Resonance SDK provides the <code class="text-cyan bg-cyan/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-sm">DetectorInterface</code> trait. Implement it to create custom acoustic classifiers that plug into the platform without touching internal code.
    </p>
    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
      <pre class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 overflow-x-auto text-sm font-mono text-white/80"><code>use resonance_sdk::detector::*;

struct MyDetector;

impl DetectorInterface for MyDetector {
    fn name(&self) -> &str { "my-detector" }
    fn version(&self) -> &str { "0.1.0" }
    fn supported_classes(&self) -> &[&str] { &["gunshot", "glass_break"] }

    fn analyze(&self, input: &DetectorInput) -> DetectorOutput {
        // Your ML model inference here
        DetectorOutput {
            classification: "gunshot".into(),
            confidence: 0.94,
            alternatives: vec![("glass_break".into(), 0.04)],
            model_version: "0.1.0".into(),
            latency_ms: 12.3,
        }
    }

    fn health(&self) -> bool { true }
}</code></pre>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h4 class="font-medium text-sm mb-1">Signal Processing</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/40">RMS, ZCR, FFT, spectral features, envelope detection</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h4 class="font-medium text-sm mb-1">Feature Extraction</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/40">MFCC, spectral centroid, rolloff, WavePrint fingerprint</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h4 class="font-medium text-sm mb-1">Testing Utilities</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Synthetic audio generation, accuracy benchmarks, latency profiling</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- API Overview -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8">Platform API</h2>
    <p class="text-white/50 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      RESTful API with WebSocket streaming. JSON responses, JWT authentication, OpenAPI specification available.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono bg-green-500/10 text-green-400">GET</span>
          <code class="text-sm text-white/70">/api/v1/incidents</code>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/40">List active incidents with spatial data, confidence, and contributing nodes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono bg-green-500/10 text-green-400">GET</span>
          <code class="text-sm text-white/70">/api/v1/nodes</code>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Node fleet status, health, timing quality, and maintenance predictions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400">WS</span>
          <code class="text-sm text-white/70">/ws/events</code>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Real-time event stream with incident creation, updates, and node telemetry.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono bg-green-500/10 text-green-400">GET</span>
          <code class="text-sm text-white/70">/api/v1/evidence/{id}</code>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Retrieve provenance chain and evidence package for a specific incident.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Repository & Contributing -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8">Repository Structure</h2>
    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
      <pre class="text-sm font-mono text-white/70 leading-relaxed"><code>resonance/
├── platform/          Core platform — correlation, incidents, API
├── edge/              Edge node runtime — acquisition, DSP, privacy
├── sdk/               Public SDK — detector interface, signal processing
├── simulator/         Virtual mesh deployment for testing
├── specifications/    Hardware and protocol specifications
├── tests/             Integration, e2e, chaos, and benchmarks
└── apps/
    └── website/       This website (Astro + Tailwind)</code></pre>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-16 mb-8">Contributing</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h4 class="font-medium mb-2">Report Issues</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/40">Found a bug or have a feature request? Open an issue on GitHub with reproduction steps.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h4 class="font-medium mb-2">Submit PRs</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/40">Fork, branch, implement, test, submit. All contributions require passing CI and a review.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h4 class="font-medium mb-2">Build Detectors</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/40">Use the SDK to build novel acoustic classifiers. Share them with the community as crates.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h4 class="font-medium mb-2">Improve Docs</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/40">Documentation PRs are always welcome. Help others understand the system.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
      <a href="https://github.com/resonance-project/resonance" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white text-graphite font-semibold hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"></path></svg>
        View on GitHub
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/resonance-project/resonance/issues" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
        Open an Issue
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
